# Ignore list for this Next.js App Router application.
#
# Every file a `next dev` or `next build` run writes into this directory is
# listed below, so after either run the working tree holds only the
# application's own sources. The list relies on no enclosing ignore file, so it
# still applies when this directory is copied somewhere else.
#
# Scope is narrow: no negations, and nothing tracked is ignored (package.json,
# tsconfig.json, next.config.ts and the app and src trees all stay in version
# control). There is no environment-file entry because the application reads no
# environment variables.

# build and dev-server output
.next/

# ambient type declarations, regenerated by every `next dev` and `next build`
next-env.d.ts

# installed dependencies
node_modules/

# incremental TypeScript build state, written because this directory's
# tsconfig.json sets `incremental: true`
*.tsbuildinfo
